# QuantPrep backups. These are the FULL app state, which includes your API keys
# in plaintext — committing one would publish them. Ignored here as a safety
# net in case a backup file is pointed at this folder, but the right home for
# it is somewhere outside the repo (a synced folder, e.g. Dropbox/iCloud).
quantprep-backup*.json
*-quantprep-backup.json
backup.json
